        "statement": "As advertisers increasingly seek to align their expenditures with actual consumer attention, optimize reach beyond the saturation of social platforms, and demand greater transparency than closed systems provide, we are well-positioned to capture any shifting demand in this space by enabling efficient, data-driven access to premium inventory across the digital advertising ecosystem.",
